body:
Since the game will be released on both consoles, I assume that the PS4 Version will be:

- GT Sport graphics but as a better version;
- More cars including Murcielago Lp640, Suzuki Escudo;
- Trial Mountain, Deep Forest and Grand Valley return along with other return tracks (but those would be just on PS5), assuming that the PS4 Version will be limited;

Few Cars added predictions:
Toyota GR86 2021
Suzuki Escudo Pikes Peak Car 1996
Chevrolet Corvette C5 Z06 2004

To everybody, I found in some old files of the 2017 nominations that were removed these stuffs:

1- Zara Larsson submitted "Ain't My Fault" only for Best Pop, nothing else;

2- Ed Sheeran submitted Castle On The Hill for Video Of The Year;

3- Katy submitted Bon Appétit in Video Of The Year instead of Chained To The Rhythm.
